comments:
I'm not familiar with scenarios where existing command would not work, outside of SSH which I already implemented as `Set-Clipboard -AsOSC52` (though it does not have a `Get` counterpart by design). Maybe just adding some use-accessible option would be the sufficient? But then they might as well alias `Get/Set-Clipboard` to those commands themselves, so "works out of the box" would be better.

Regarding the cache, simply do a lazy getter pattern:

```cs
private string _clipboardCommand;
public string ClipboardCommand => !_clipboardCommand.IsNullOrEmpty() ? _clipboardCommand : (_clipboardCommand = ChooseClipboardCommand());
```
